# /home/zalo/.zalo-agent-cli/.env      read by EVERY zalo-agent command run as zalo: each unit (systemd sets
# HOME for User=zalo) and each `za ...` by hand, so all of them open the same files.
#   sudo install -m 600 -o zalo -g zalo home.env /home/zalo/.zalo-agent-cli/.env
# Machine paths belong here, never in common.env (a command run by hand does not read that).
# A folder set here must also be in the units' ReadWritePaths, and exist: `fleet generate
# --data-dir / --media-dir` writes both; by hand, change both.

ZALO_AGENT_NO_UPDATE_CHECK=1
# ZALO_DATA_DIR=/srv/zalo/accounts
# ZALO_MEDIA_DIR=/srv/zalo/media
